          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对判定为中文的歌词生效，例如 你好 → nǐ hǎo；默认关闭，中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics judged Chinese, e.g. 你好 → nǐ hǎo; off by default, since pinyin over Chinese lyrics is usually a distraction for Chinese readers"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只对判定为中文的歌词生效，例如 你好 → nǐ hǎo；默认关闭，中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对判定为日语的歌词生效，例如 こんにちは → konnichiwa" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics judged Japanese, e.g. こんにちは → konnichiwa"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只对判定为日语的歌词生效，例如 こんにちは → konnichiwa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对判定为该语言的歌词生效；判定按整首歌进行，混排的歌以出现的假名/谚文/汉字为准。中文默认关闭——中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics detected as that language. Detection runs per song, using the kana / hangul / han characters that appear. Chinese is off by default — pinyin over Chinese lyrics is usually a distraction for readers of Chinese"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只对判定为该语言的歌词生效；判定按整首歌进行，混排的歌以出现的假名/谚文/汉字为准。中文默认关闭——中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对判定为韩语的歌词生效，例如 안녕하세요 → annyeonghaseyo" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics judged Korean, e.g. 안녕하세요 → annyeonghaseyo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只对判定为韩语的歌词生效，例如 안녕하세요 → annyeonghaseyo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响装得下的句子。\n\n固定：短句也占满设定宽度，右边留白，菜单栏上的位置不会变。\n\n自适应（不建议）：短句按自己的宽度占位，省下多余空间——代价是每换一句都要重建菜单栏这一项。系统只在项出生那一刻给邻居排位，重建太密时邻居图标会停在旧位置（错位、闪动），左键面板也可能被挤掉。想稳定就用固定。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only affects lines that already fit.\n\nFixed: short lines still fill the width you set, leaving space on the right, so the item never moves.\n\nAdaptive (not recommended): short lines take only the width they need — the cost is that the menu bar item is rebuilt on every line change. The system only lays out neighboring items at the moment this one is born, so frequent rebuilds leave neighboring icons stranded at their old positions (misaligned, flickering), and the left-click panel can get dismissed. Use Fixed if you want stability."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只影响装得下的句子。\n\n固定：短句也占满设定宽度，右边留白，菜单栏上的位置不会变。\n\n自适应（不建议）：短句按自己的宽度占位，省下多余空间——代价是每换一句都要重建菜单栏这一项。系统只在项出生那一刻给邻居排位，重建太密时邻居图标会停在旧位置（错位、闪动），左键面板也可能被挤掉。想稳定就用固定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只抹掉本机设置，无法撤销；iCloud 和已导出的备份不受影响" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erases only this Mac's settings and can't be undone; your iCloud copy and any exported backups are untouched"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只抹掉本机设置，无法撤销；iCloud 和已导出的备份不受影响"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只接管文字颜色；背景色和描边色始终按下面设置的来" : {
